request.description:
PATCH fields are optional, but at least one is required. Null clears nullable fields only. To clear client tier instead, replace the whole body with:
{
  "userOffer": null,
  "userCouponCode": null,
  "userOfferUrl": null
}

Slugs generated server-side and stable on edit. Unknown fields rejected. See shared-types/resource.ts for optional fields. To create a perk stack instead, replace the whole body with:
{
  "kind": "perk_stack",
  "title": "Example stack",
  "itemIds": [
    "{{perkId}}"
  ]
}

kind is one of learning_playlist, perk_stack, template_kit; itemIds must be ids of that kind (videos, perks or templates). To create a template kit instead, replace the whole body with:
{
  "kind": "template_kit",
  "title": "New audit engagement",
  "itemIds": ["{{templateId}}"]
}

Slug race (2026-10-30): regenerated and retried 3 times, then `409 RESOURCE_SLUG_TAKEN`.
